  &gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Shade Cloud by kyle parker cunningham&lt;&#x2F;figcaption&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;figure&gt;





&lt;figure class=&quot;art-image&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
